{"identity_key": "x:2126693849523192062", "source_id": "x", "item_id": "2126693849523192062", "title": null, "content": "7年前の本日は ChuSingura46+1 わっちとお兄ちゃんのラブラブ長屋生活 (プレカノ) の発売日でした\n\n\n\nChuSinGura46+1スピンオフ\n\n\n\n赤穂浪士の討ち入り阻止に失敗し直刃の元で暮らすこととなる物語\n\n新八郎との同棲イチャラブ要素に加え葉山こよーて氏の時折見せる江戸時代の歴史雑学が素晴らしい物語でした", "publisher": "youtan0309", "canonical_url": "https://x.com/youtan0309/status/2126693849523192062", "published_at": "2026-11-28T15:05:00+00:00", "published_at_raw": "Sat, 28 Nov 2026 15:05:00 GMT", "published_precision": "second", "fetched_at": "2026-11-28T16:20:13.824789+00:00", "media": [], "metadata": {"account": "youtan0309", "author_name": "youtan0309", "is_retweet": false, "retweeted_by": null, "is_reply": false, "reply_to": null, "is_quote": false, "quoted_tweet_id": null, "quoted_author": null, "quoted_text": null, "is_pinned": false, "stats": {"replies": null, "retweets": null, "likes": null, "views": null}, "provider": "nitter", "route": "rss"}}
{"identity_key": "x:2126695107382403380", "source_id": "x", "item_id": "2126695107382403380", "title": null, "content": "7年前の本日は どっちのiが好きですか？ (HOOK) の発売日でした\n\n\n\n女の子一人で二度オイシイ恋愛ADV\n\n\n\nヒロインをリードするかorリードされて交際するかを選び物語を勧めていく作品\n\nHOOKというよりSMEEのノリに近いコメディ作品\n\n4人×2√のボリュームと飽きさせない面白さにテンポよく楽しめる良作でした", "publisher": "youtan0309", "canonical_url": "https://x.com/youtan0309/status/2126695107382403380", "published_at": "2026-11-28T15:10:00+00:00", "published_at_raw": "Sat, 28 Nov 2026 15:10:00 GMT", "published_precision": "second", "fetched_at": "2026-11-28T16:20:13.824789+00:00", "media": [], "metadata": {"account": "youtan0309", "author_name": "youtan0309", "is_retweet": false, "retweeted_by": null, "is_reply": false, "reply_to": null, "is_quote": false, "quoted_tweet_id": null, "quoted_author": null, "quoted_text": null, "is_pinned": false, "stats": {"replies": null, "retweets": null, "likes": null, "views": null}, "provider": "nitter", "route": "rss"}}
